PTX MP+griddepcontrol+no-wait
"As MP+griddepcontrol.wait without the wait: the grids may overlap. Expected: allowed."
{
x=0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0,grid 0            | P1@cta 0,gpu 0,grid 1 ;
 st.weak.global x, 1              | ld.weak.global r0, x  ;
 griddepcontrol.launch_dependents |                       ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 0)
